{
	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "web-url-quiz-gen-001",
		"name": "Quizify - Web URL Quiz Generation",
		"description": "Comprehensive test suite for Web URL quiz generation feature.\n\n**Feature Overview:**\n- Generate quizzes from web page URLs using Playwright + Trafilatura\n- Available for all tiers (Free: 5 quizzes, Basic: 20, Educator: 500)\n- Standard mode (fast) and Enhanced mode (RAG-based with Bloom's taxonomy)\n- SSRF protection (blocks private IPs, localhost)\n- 30-second timeout, min 100 chars, max 500KB content\n- Quota enforcement applies to all tiers\n\n**Generation Modes:**\n- mode='standard': Fast quiz generation\n- mode='enhanced': RAG-based quality with Bloom's taxonomy, difficulty levels, concept tracking\n\n**Setup Instructions:**\n1. Set `{{base_url}}` variable (e.g., http://localhost:8000 or https://api.quizify.app)\n2. Set `{{auth_token}}` variable with your JWT token\n3. Set `{{user_tier}}` to test different scenarios (free/basic/educator)\n4. Run \"Setup\" folder first to configure test environment\n5. Test scenarios are organized by tier and error conditions\n\n**Test Coverage:**\n- ✅ Standard and Enhanced mode generation\n- ✅ Free tier with quota limits\n- ✅ Basic tier success\n- ✅ Educator tier success\n- ✅ Quota enforcement for all tiers\n- ✅ SSRF protection (localhost, private IPs)\n- ✅ URL validation\n- ✅ Content extraction validation\n- ✅ Timeout handling\n- ✅ Error responses\n\n**Last Updated:** 2025-12-24\n**Implementation:** services/web_scraping_service.py, handlers/quiz_handlers.py",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
	"item": [
