							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Deep_learning\",\n  \"title\": \"Deep Learning Quiz (Enhanced)\",\n  \"num_questions\": 8,\n  \"question_type\": [\"multiple_choice\", \"true_false\"],\n  \"mode\": \"enhanced\"\n}",
							"options": {
								"raw": {
									"language": "json"
								}
							}
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/quiz/generate/url",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["api", "quiz", "generate", "url"]
						},
						"description": "Generate quiz using Enhanced mode (RAG-based with Bloom's taxonomy).\n\n**Enhanced Mode Features:**\n- RAG-based question generation for higher quality\n- Bloom's taxonomy levels: remember, understand, apply, analyze, evaluate, create\n- Difficulty levels: easy, medium, hard\n- Concept tracking for better content coverage\n- Fact-checking and validation\n- Distractor explanations for MCQ (why wrong answers are wrong)\n\n**Response includes:**\n- questions[].bloom_level: Cognitive level (remember, understand, apply, analyze, evaluate, create)\n- questions[].difficulty: easy, medium, hard\n- questions[].concept_name: Human-readable concept being tested\n- questions[].confidence_score: AI confidence in question quality\n- questions[].distractor_explanations: Why each wrong option is incorrect (MCQ only)\n- generation_stats: Chunks processed, concepts identified, tokens used"
					},
					"response": []
				}
			],
			"description": "Test Enhanced mode quiz generation with RAG and Bloom's taxonomy"
		},
